			"Message": "feat(Sky): Initialize Mist WebSocket for direct Sky-Cocoon communication\n\nAdd B7-S6 bootstrap stage to establish Mist WebSocket connection between Sky (editor UI) and Cocoon (extension host) via Mountain's native host. The WebSocket configuration is retrieved through Tauri IPC invoke to Mountain, then passed to Wind's TauriMainProcessService.InitializeWebSocket.\n\nFormatting cleanup in jsconfig.json and tsconfig.json: convert inline arrays to multi-line format for consistency. Remove Effect.runPromise wrapper from runBootstrap call as the Effect is now executed directly. Add whitespace in BootstrapStage and BootstrapResult interfaces and around conditional blocks for readability.\n\nThis enables the direct Sky<->Cocoon WebSocket path bypassing Tauri event loop for lower-latency extension host communication.",
			"SHA": "2044404c12c4db5766af564110ea2c5a8f5144c2"
		}
	],
